WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.950
How to support a friend. When someone you care about is struggling.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.950
Listen first. Give your full attention. You do not need perfect words.

3
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:16.950
Ask how they are really doing. Use a calm voice and open questions.

4
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.950
Do not judge or rush to fix. Say: I am here, and I am glad you told me.

5
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:28.950
Encourage professional help. Offer to go with them to a clinic or counseling office.

6
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:35.950
If they may be in danger. Stay with them, call 911 or the NCMH hotline 1553, and tell a trusted adult.

